# M17 "Görevler", flow "m17_home" (Tanyeri: StartZone = 0, a new Aydor warrior starts in its homeland; at 1280x720 and
# 1920x1080): the upgrade hub is Eşik - Usta Berkay's window has no "Yükselt" tab and says where tav work is done
# (the stones are still sold); a forced UPGRADE_REQ is refused ("Bu satıcı eşya yükseltmez."). Sancaktar Ece, the
# homeland's quest giver, stands beside the stalls with no gem over her yet (her quests follow Eşik's line).
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m17_home
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.aydor
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.1
clickon create.name
text Burcadonen
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+zone2+questsknown+npcs3+npcanimated 1800
waitfor world+nobanner 400
scene expectmarker Sancaktar_Ece none
scene walktonpc Usta Berkay 2.2
waitfor world+nodest+standing 900
scene talk Usta Berkay
waitfor world+shopopen+inv 900
scene expectshop Usta Berkay
expecttext shop.note Tav işi Eşik'te yapılır: Demirci Ilgaz'a git.
expecttext shop.contents Ham Tav Taşı 25
scene expectnooverlap
scene camera at:Usta_Berkay@14 16 6
wait 8
screenshot 01_homeland_smith_no_tab.png
scene upgradeforce 0
waitfor world+upgraderefused1+upgradeidle 300
scene expectshopmessage Bu satıcı eşya yükseltmez.
wait 3
screenshot 02_homeland_smith_refuses.png
scene shopclose
scene walktonpc Sancaktar Ece 5
waitfor world+nodest+standing 900
scene camera at:Sancaktar_Ece@40 12 6
wait 8
screenshot 03_homeland_quest_giver.png